From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Prithwiraj Samanta <app@datainsights.ae>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 17:27:03 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] telecode: sync design tokens with variable collections
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

telecode_variables_apply upserts collections, modes and variables by name
(ids are document-local), so TeleDesign can mirror a design system's
tokens.json — light/dark themes become modes of one collection — and
pushing twice is a no-op. Nothing is deleted. One undo step restores the
whole variable state. telecode_variables_read returns every collection
with its modes and each variable's value per mode name (colours as hex,
aliases as Collection/name) for the reverse sync.
